 align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES facility is being structured by African Green Farmers Limited as a bankable, audit-ready, ESG-aligned industrial platform capable of absorbing institutional capital responsibility while delivering measurable environmental, social, and financial returns.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Our governance framework reduces systemic risk, strengthens regulatory acceptance, and enhances international market credibility- poisoning AGF as a trusted partner for long-term, impact-oriented investment.</span></strong></p>', '<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 120px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(1)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Governance, Compliance &amp; Transparency</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">AGF is committed to strong corporate governance, regulatory compliance, and financial transparency as foundational pillars of sustainable industrial growth.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong>The USD 40+ million capital deployment as seed capital prioritizes GMP (Good Manufacturing Practice)compliant infrastructure, ISO certification systems (<span style=\"line-height: 103%;\">ISO 9001, 22000, 14001, 45001 and 14644</span>), maintenance of annual independent financial audits, ESG (Environmental, Social and Governance) performance reporting, risk management oversight, and board-level governance structures, ensuring accountability and institutional integrity.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong></span></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h5 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 320px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Governance Commitments:</span></em></span></h5>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Full GMP implementation and documentation</span></strong></span></em></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->ISO certification roadmap completion</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Annual independent financial audits</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->ESG performance monitoring and reporting</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><!--[endif]-->Structured compliance and risk management systems</span></em></span></strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2)<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Institutional Oversight and Accountability</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">AGF Company operates under a structured corporate governance model that assures;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.55pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clear separation between shareholders, Boards, and Executive Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Defined fiduciary responsibilities and delegated authority frameworks</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Independent advisory expertise in regulatory science, finance, ESG and risk management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.15pt 27pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Structured board oversight on strategy, compliance and capital allocation</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">This governance framework aligns with international best practices recognized by institutions such as International Finance Corporation and the World Bank.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 200px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(2) Regulatory Compliance, Quality Assurance &amp; Licensing</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">AGF is building an integrated compliance ecosystem aligned with international recognized standards, including but not limited to:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001-Quality Management System</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 22000-Food Safety Management</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001- Environmental Governance and Sustainability</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.3pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001- Occupational Health &amp; Safety</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 15.35pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 200px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644- Cleanroom Qualification<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Our production roadmap integrates Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), </span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">validated laboratory systems, traceability controls, and regulatory documentation protocols required for&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>export-oriented <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;</span>TCAM, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Nutraceutical/Food <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>Supplement, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Phytomedicine&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and Phytopharmaceutical, Fortified Clean-Label Health Food Product and Fruit Beverage regional and international markets.</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 102%; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES is subjected to the following regulatory licensing:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 1.9pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) Certificate- ZEMA</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt 27.15pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 1