le=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">NUFOTEC ina uvumilivu sifuri kwa ulaghai, ufisadi, ununuzi usio wa kimaadili au ukosefu wa utiifu wa udhibiti.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(4) Uhakikisho kwa wawekezaji na wafadhili</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mifumo yetu ya utawala na utiifu imeundwa kuhakikisha kwamba mtaji unaopelekwa katika kituo cha NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Unalindwa na usimamizi ulioundwa</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Umetengwa kulingana na hatua za kimkakati zilizoidhinishwa</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.5pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ufuatiliwa kupitia viashiria vinavyopimika vya utendaji wa ESG na kifedha<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 7.4pt 27pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Unaripotiwa kwa uwazi kwa wanahisa</strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">(5) Taarifa ya msimamo wa kimkakati wa uwekezaji</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.85pt -0.25pt; padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kituo cha NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES kimeundwa na African Green Farmers Limited kama jukwaa la kiviwanda linaloweza kukopesheka, tayari kwa ukaguzi, linalolingana na ESG na linaloweza kunyonya mtaji wa kitaasisi kwa uwajibikaji huku ikizalisha mapato yanayopimika ya kimazingira, kijamii na kifedha.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; padding-left: 80px;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Muundo wetu wa utawala unapunguza hatari za kimfumo, huimarisha kukubalika kwa udhibiti na kuongeza uaminifu katika masoko ya kimataifa – na kumweka NUFOTEC kama mshirika anayeaminika kwa uwekezaji wa muda mrefu unaoendeshwa na athari.</span></strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>', NULL, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 21:24:54', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(119, 5, 'texte', 'Research & Innovation', 'Recherche et innovation', 'Research and innovation', 'Utafiti na uvumbuzi', '', '', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">At African Green Farmers Limited, research and innovation constitute the scientific backbone of our vertically integrated model&mdash;from sustainable cultivation of medicinal plants and functional crops to the development of standardized TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements, clean-label fortified health food products and fruit beverages, preclinical research-based phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals, clinically validated phytopharmaceutical products for domestic, regional and international markets. Our research strategy integrates ethnobotanical intelligence, modern pharmacognosy, phytochemistry, molecular biology, biotechnology and translational preclinical sciences to transform indigenous bioresources into evidence-based, regulatory-compliant health products.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">1.</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Integrated Research Architecture </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Our innovation ecosystem is structured across five technical pillars</span>:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. Ethnobotanical Intelligence &amp; Biodiversity Valorization</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We systematically document, validate and prioritize medicinal plant species using evidencebased screening criteria, focusing on high-burden diseases, metabolic disorders, immune health and preventive nutrition. This ensures both scientific relevance and strong market viability.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">B. Phytochemical Standardization &amp; Molecular Profiling</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Using advanced analytical platforms (UHPLC-MS/MS<span style=\"color: red;\">, </span>GC-MS/MS 8000<span style=\"color: red;\">, </span>HPAAS<span style=\"color: red;\">, </span>AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR, and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer), we:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identify active marker compounds</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Establish quantitative phytochemical fingerprints</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ensure batch-to-batch reproducibility</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop standardized extracts meeting international pharmacopeial thresholds</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This scientific rigor differentiates our products from traditional herbal preparations and positions them as standardized phytopharmaceutical-grade formulations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">C. Bioprocessing &amp; Bio-enhancement Technologies</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We apply controlled fermentation systems, microbial biotechnology (including selected LAB strains where applicable), and green extraction technologies to:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Increase bioavailability</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Enhance active compound concentration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Improve stability and shelf life</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Optimize pharmacodynamic performance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">D. Preclinical &amp; Translational Research</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Through our planned laboratory animal research platform, we conduct:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Toxicological profiling</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic studies</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Dose optimization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mechanism-of-action validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This bridges traditional knowledge with evidence-based medicine and supports regulatory approval pathways.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">E. Product Development &amp; Regulatory Alignment</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We design formulations aligned with:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->WHO Traditional Medicine Strategy</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->African Medicines Agency harmonization frameworks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->International GMP standards</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ESG and sustainability compliance benchmarks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Each product progresses through defined Technology Readiness Levels (TRLs), ensuring clear de-risking milestones for investors.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">F. Research-to-Market Pipeline</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 180.7pt .85pt 17.25pt;\">Our innovation pipeline follows a structured 7-stage model: <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">&sect;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Biodiversity mapping &amp; species selection</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Phytochemical screening &amp; active compound validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Standardized extract development</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preclinical safety &amp; efficacy studies</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pilot-scale GMP production</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regulatory dossier preparation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Commercial scale-up &amp; market deployment</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This pipeline reduces technical uncertainty, accelerates time-to-market, and protects investor capital through phased risk mitigation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">G. Innovation with Measurable Outcomes <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">(2031 Targets) </span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">By 2031, AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES will have:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Developed multiple standardized phytopharmaceutical product lines</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Established a fully operational research-grade analytical laboratory</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filed proprietary formulations and intellectual property assets</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Achieved international-quality certifications</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Generated validated clinical data supporting global commercialization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&uuml;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Positioned as a regional hub for evidence-based phytomedicine innovation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">H. ESG-Driven Scientific Innovation</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Our research platform is built on:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Sustainable raw material sourcing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Climate-smart organic cultivation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Zero-waste bioprocessing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Community-inclusive value chains</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Gender-inclusive scientific workforce development</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Scientific excellence and sustainability are not parallel strategies&mdash;they are integrated drivers of long-term value creation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">I.<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Sustainability &amp; Long-Term Value Creation</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: 408.5pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">AGF integrates climate-smart agriculture, soil regeneration, responsible resource use, and inclusive economic participation into its core operations. Expansion to over 2,000 hectares will integrate thousands of smallholder farmers, increase rural incomes, and generate skilled industrial employment while contributing to regional pharmaceutical self-reliance and sustainable industrial growth. </span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Chez NUFOTEC, la recherche et l\'innovation constituent l\'épine dorsale scientifique de notre modèle intégré verticalement &ndash; de la culture durable de plantes médicinales et de cultures fonctionnelles au développement de MTCAs standardisées, de nutraceutiques/compléments alimentaires, d\'aliments santé fortifiés clean-label et de boissons aux fruits, de phytomédicines et phytopharmaceutiques basés sur la recherche préclinique, de produits phytopharmaceutiques cliniquement validés pour les marchés domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Notre stratégie de recherche intègre l\'intelligence ethnobotanique, la pharmacognosie moderne, la phytochimie, la biologie moléculaire, la biotechnologie et les sciences précliniques translationnelles pour transformer les bioressources indigènes en produits de santé fondés sur des preuves et conformes à la réglementation.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">1.</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Architecture de recherche intégrée </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Notre écosystème d\'innovation est structuré autour de cinq piliers techniques</span> :</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. Intelligence ethnobotanique et valorisation de la biodiversité</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Nous documentons, validons et priorisons systématiquement les espèces de plantes médicinales en utilisant des critères de criblage basés sur des preuves, en nous concentrant sur les maladies à forte charge de morbidité, les troubles métaboliques, la santé immunitaire et la nutrition préventive. Cela garantit à la fois une pertinence scientifique et une forte viabilité commerciale.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">B. Standardisation phytochimique et profilage moléculaire</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">En utilisant des plateformes analytiques avancées (UHPLC-MS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000, HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR, et High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer), nous :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identifions les composés marqueurs actifs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Établissons des empreintes phytochimiques quantitatives</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Garantissons la reproductibilité lot à lot</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Développons des extraits standardisés répondant aux seuils pharmacopéiques internationaux</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Cette rigueur scientifique différencie nos produits des préparations à base de plantes traditionnelles et les positionne comme des formulations standardisées de qualité phytopharmaceutique.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">C. Technologies de bioprocédés et de bio-amélioration</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Nous appliquons des systèmes de fermentation contrôlée, des biotechnologies microbiennes (y compris des souches de LAB sélectionnées le cas échéant) et des technologies d\'extraction verte pour :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Augmenter la biodisponibilité</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Améliorer la concentration des composés actifs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Améliorer la stabilité et la durée de conservation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Optimiser les performances pharmacodynamiques</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">D. Recherche préclinique et translationnelle</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Grâce à notre plateforme de recherche sur les animaux de laboratoire prévue, nous menons :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Des profils toxicologiques</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Des études pharmacocinétiques et pharmacodynamiques</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Une optimisation des doses</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Une validation du mécanisme d\'action</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Cela fait le pont entre les connaissances traditionnelles et la médecine factuelle et soutient les voies d\'approbation réglementaire.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">E. Développement de produits et alignement réglementaire</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Nous concevons des formulations alignées sur :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->La Stratégie de Médecine Traditionnelle de l\'OMS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Les cadres d\'harmonisation de l\'Agence Africaine du Médicament</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Les normes internationales BPF</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Les référentiels de conformité ESG et de durabilité</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Chaque produit progresse à travers des Niveaux de Maturité Technologique (TRL) définis, garantissant des jalons clairs de réduction des risques pour les investisseurs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">F. Pipeline de la recherche au marché</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 180.7pt .85pt 17.25pt;\">Notre pipeline d\'innovation suit un modèle structuré en 7 étapes : <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">§</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Cartographie de la biodiversité & sélection des espèces</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Criblage phytochimique & validation des composés actifs</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Développement d\'extraits standardisés</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Études précliniques de sécurité & d\'efficacité</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Production pilote BPF</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Préparation des dossiers réglementaires</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mise à l\'échelle commerciale & déploiement sur le marché</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Ce pipeline réduit l\'incertitude technique, accélère le délai de mise sur le marché et protège le capital des investisseurs grâce à une atténuation des risques par phases.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">G. Innovation avec des résultats mesurables <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">(Objectifs 2031) </span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">D\'ici 2031, NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES aura :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Développé plusieurs gammes de produits phytopharmaceutiques standardisés</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Établi un laboratoire analytique de recherche entièrement opérationnel</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Déposé des formulations propriétaires et des actifs de propriété intellectuelle</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Obtenu des certifications de qualité internationale</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Généré des données cliniques validées soutenant la commercialisation mondiale</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Positionnée comme un pôle régional d\'innovation en phytomédecine fondée sur des preuves</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">H. Innovation scientifique axée sur les critères ESG</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Notre plateforme de recherche repose sur :</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un approvisionnement durable en matières premières</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Une culture biologique climato-intelligente</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Des bioprocédés zéro déchet</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Des chaînes de valeur inclusives pour les communautés</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Un développement de la main-d\'œuvre scientifique inclusive en matière de genre</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->L\'excellence scientifique et la durabilité ne sont pas des stratégies parallèles &ndash; ce sont des moteurs intégrés de création de valeur à long terme.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">I.<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Durabilité et création de valeur à long terme</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: 408.5pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">NUFOTEC intègre l\'agriculture climato-intelligente, la régénération des sols, l\'utilisation responsable des ressources et la participation économique inclusive dans ses activités principales. L\'expansion à plus de 2 000 hectares intégrera des milliers de petits exploitants agricoles, augmentera les revenus ruraux et générera des emplois industriels qualifiés tout en contribuant à l\'autonomie pharmaceutique régionale et à la croissance industrielle durable. </span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">At NUFOTEC, research and innovation are the scientific backbone of our vertically integrated model – from sustainable cultivation of medicinal plants and functional crops to the development of standardized TCAMs, nutraceuticals/dietary supplements, clean-label fortified health foods and fruit drinks, phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals based on preclinical research, clinically validated phytopharmaceutical products for domestic, regional and international markets. Our research strategy integrates ethnobotanical intelligence, modern pharmacognosy, phytochemistry, molecular biology, biotechnology and translational preclinical sciences to transform indigenous bioresources into evidence-based, regulation-compliant health products.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">1.</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Integrated research architecture </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Our innovation ecosystem is structured around five technical pillars</span> :</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. Ethnobotanical intelligence and biodiversity valorization</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We systematically document, validate and prioritize medicinal plant species using evidence-based screening criteria, focusing on high-burden diseases, metabolic disorders, immune health and preventive nutrition. This ensures both scientific relevance and strong commercial viability.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">B. Phytochemical standardization and molecular profiling</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Using advanced analytical platforms (UHPLC-MS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000, HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR, and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer), we:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identify active marker compounds</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Establish quantitative phytochemical fingerprints</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ensure batch-to-batch reproducibility</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop standardized extracts meeting international pharmacopoeia thresholds</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This scientific rigor differentiates our products from traditional herbal preparations and positions them as standardized phytopharmaceutical-quality formulations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">C. Bioprocess and bio-enhancement technologies</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We apply controlled fermentation systems, microbial biotechnologies (including selected LAB strains where applicable) and green extraction technologies to:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Increase bioavailability</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Improve active compound concentration</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Enhance stability and shelf life</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Optimize pharmacodynamic performance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">D. Preclinical and translational research</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Through our planned laboratory animal research platform, we conduct:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Toxicological profiles</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic studies</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Dose optimization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mechanism of action validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This bridges traditional knowledge and evidence-based medicine and supports regulatory approval pathways.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">E. Product development and regulatory alignment</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">We design formulations aligned with:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->WHO Traditional Medicine Strategy</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->African Medicines Agency harmonization frameworks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->International GMP standards</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ESG compliance and sustainability frameworks</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Each product progresses through defined Technology Readiness Levels (TRL), ensuring clear risk-reduction milestones for investors.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">F. Research-to-market pipeline</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 180.7pt .85pt 17.25pt;\">Our innovation pipeline follows a structured 7-step model: <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">§</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Biodiversity mapping & species selection</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Phytochemical screening & active compound validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Standardized extract development</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preclinical safety & efficacy studies</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->GMP pilot production</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regulatory dossier preparation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Commercial scale-up & market deployment</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This pipeline reduces technical uncertainty, accelerates time-to-market and protects investor capital through phased risk mitigation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">G. Innovation with measurable outcomes <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">(2031 Targets) </span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">By 2031, NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES will have:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Developed several standardized phytopharmaceutical product ranges</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Established a fully operational analytical research laboratory</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Filed proprietary formulations and intellectual property assets</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Obtained international quality certifications</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Generated validated clinical data supporting global commercialization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Positioned as a regional hub for evidence-based phytomedicine innovation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">H. ESG-driven scientific innovation</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Our research platform relies on:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Sustainable raw material sourcing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Climate-smart organic farming</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Zero-waste bioprocesses</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Inclusive value chains for communities</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Gender-inclusive scientific workforce development</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Scientific excellence and sustainability are not parallel strategies – they are integrated drivers of long-term value creation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">I.<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Sustainability and long-term value creation</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: 408.5pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">NUFOTEC integrates climate-smart agriculture, soil regeneration, responsible resource use and inclusive economic participation into its core activities. The expansion to more than 2,000 hectares will integrate thousands of smallholder farmers, increase rural incomes and generate skilled industrial jobs while contributing to regional pharmaceutical self-sufficiency and sustainable industrial growth.</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Katika NUFOTEC, utafiti na uvumbuzi ni uti wa mgongo wa kisayansi wa muundo wetu uliojumuishwa kiwima – kutoka kwa kilimo endelevu cha mimea ya dawa na mazao ya kazi hadi ukuzaji wa TCAMs sanifu, virutubisho/viongeza vya lishe, vyakula vya afya vilivyoimarishwa lebo-safi na vinywaji vya matunda, dawa za mimea na dawa za mimea kulingana na utafiti wa kabla ya kliniki, bidhaa za dawa za mimea zilizothibitishwa kikliniki kwa masoko ya ndani, ya kikanda na kimataifa. Mkakati wetu wa utafiti unajumuisha akili ya kiethnobotania, pharmacognosia ya kisasa, fitokemia, biolojia ya molekuli, bioteknolojia na sayansi ya tafsiri ya kabla ya kliniki kubadilisha rasilimali za asili kuwa bidhaa za afya zenye ushahidi na zinazozingatia kanuni.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">1.</strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Usanifu jumuishi wa utafiti </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);\">Mfumo wetu wa uvumbuzi umeundwa kuzunguka nguzo tano za kiufundi</span> :</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">A. Akili ya kiethnobotania na uthamini wa bioanuwai</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Tunakusanya, kuthibitisha na kuweka kipaumbele kwa utaratibu spishi za mimea ya dawa kwa kutumia vigezo vya uchunguzi wa ushahidi, tukizingatia magonjwa yenye mzigo mkubwa, matatizo ya kimetaboliki, afya ya kinga na lishe ya kuzuia. Hii inahakikisha umuhimu wa kisayansi na uwezo mkubwa wa kibiashara.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">B. Usanifishaji wa fitokemia na upigaji picha wa molekuli</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Kwa kutumia majukwaa ya uchanganuzi ya hali ya juu (UHPLC-MS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000, HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR, na High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer), sisi:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kutambua misombo ya alama inayofanya kazi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuanzisha alama za vidole za kiasi cha fitokemia</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuhakikisha uzazi wa kundi hadi kundi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuandaa dondoo sanifu zinazokidhi viwango vya kimataifa vya pharmacopoeia</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Ukali huu wa kisayansi unatofautisha bidhaa zetu na maandalizi ya jadi ya mitishamba na kuziweka kama uundaji sanifu wa ubora wa dawa za mimea.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">C. Teknolojia za bioprocess na uboreshaji wa kibayolojia</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Tunatumia mifumo ya uchachishaji inayodhibitiwa, teknolojia za kibayolojia za vijidudu (pamoja na aina za LAB zilizochaguliwa inapofaa) na teknolojia za uchimbaji wa kijani ili:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuongeza upatikanaji wa bayolojia</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuboresha mkusanyiko wa misombo hai</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuongeza utulivu na maisha ya rafu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuboresha utendaji wa pharmacodynamiki</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">D. Utafiti wa kabla ya kliniki na tafsiri</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Kupitia jukwaa letu la utafiti wa wanyama wa maabara lililopangwa, tunafanya:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Profaili za sumu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Uchunguzi wa pharmacokinetic na pharmacodynamic</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Uboreshaji wa kipimo</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Uthibitishaji wa utaratibu wa hatua</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Hii inaunganisha maarifa ya jadi na dawa za ushahidi na inasaidia njia za uidhinishaji wa udhibiti.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">E. Ukuzaji wa bidhaa na usawazishaji wa udhibiti</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Tunabuni uundaji unaolingana na:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mkakati wa Dawa za Jadi wa WHO</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mifumo ya upatanishi ya Wakala wa Dawa wa Afrika</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Viwango vya kimataifa vya GMP</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mifumo ya utiifu ya ESG na uendelevu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kila bidhaa inaendelea kupitia Viwango vya Utayari wa Teknolojia (TRL) vilivyobainishwa, kuhakikisha hatua za wazi za kupunguza hatari kwa wawekezaji.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">F. Bomba la utafiti hadi soko</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 180.7pt .85pt 17.25pt;\">Bomba letu la uvumbuzi linafuata muundo wa hatua 7: <span style=\"font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\">§</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Ramani ya bioanuwai & uteuzi wa spishi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Uchunguzi wa fitokemia & uthibitisho wa kiwanja hai</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ukuzaji wa dondoo sanifu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Masomo ya usalama wa kabla ya kliniki na ufanisi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Uzalishaji wa majaribio wa GMP</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Utayarishaji wa hati za udhibiti</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kuongeza kiwango cha kibiashara na kupelekwa sokoni</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Bomba hili linapunguza kutokuwa na uhakika wa kiufundi, kuharakisha muda wa kuingia sokoni na kulinda mtaji wa wawekezaji kupitia kupunguza hatari kwa awamu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">G. Ubunifu wenye matokeo yanayoweza kupimika <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">(Malengo 2031) </span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Kufikia 2031, NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES itakuwa:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imetengeneza bidhaa kadhaa sanifu za dawa za mimea</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imeanzisha maabara ya uchambuzi ya utafiti inayofanya kazi kikamilifu</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imewasilisha uundaji wa wamiliki na mali za miliki</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imepata vyeti vya ubora vya kimataifa</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imetoa data ya kliniki iliyothibitishwa inayounga mkono uuzaji wa kimataifa</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">ü<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Imejiweka kama kitovu cha kikanda cha uvumbuzi wa dawa za mimea zenye ushahidi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">H. Ubunifu wa kisayansi unaoendeshwa na ESG</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Jukwaa letu la utafiti linategemea:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Upatikanaji endelevu wa malighafi</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Kilimo cha kikaboni kinachozingatia hali ya hewa</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Michakato ya kibayolojia isiyo na taka</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minyororo ya thamani jumuishi kwa jamii</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ukuzaji wa wafanyikazi wa kisayansi unaojumuisha jinsia</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">§<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ubora wa kisayansi na uendelevu si mikakati sambamba – ni viendeshaji jumuishi vya kuunda thamani ya muda mrefu.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: -.25pt;\">I.<span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> </span>Uendelevu na uundaji wa thamani ya muda mrefu</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: 408.5pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">NUFOTEC inajumuisha kilimo cha akili ya hali ya hewa, urejeshaji wa udongo, matumizi ya kuwajibika ya rasilimali na ushiriki wa kiuchumi unaojumuisha katika shughuli zake za msingi. Upanuzi hadi zaidi ya hekta 2,000 utajumuisha maelfu ya wakulima wadogo, kuongeza mapato ya vijijini na kuzalisha ajira za viwandani zilizohitimu huku ikichangia kujitosheleza kwa dawa za kikanda na ukuaji endelevu wa viwanda.</span></p>', NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 21:37:21', NULL, 1);
