 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .4pt 9.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 98%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Security wire fence surrounding the whole farmland</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -9.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Security guards</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -9.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 9.0pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Perimeter security, CCTV cameras, community engagement, access controls</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; height: 32.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 3.95pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>9</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .8pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Unexpected losses (climate, market, fire)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 32.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .85pt;\"><strong>Crop and asset insurance, contingency funds, prudent financial planning</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; height: 48.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>10</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Macroeconomic and Foreign Exchange Risks: Currency fluctuations, inflation, and import constraints</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: center 154.0pt right 239.95pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>USD-denominated <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>exports, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>multi-</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>currency accounts, and natural hedging</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>11</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Political and Regulatory Risks: Policy shifts, licensing delays, and taxation changes</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 3.6pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><strong>Proactive engagement with regulators, legal advisory, and diversification across markets</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; height: 48.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>12</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Supply Chain Risks: Variability in raw materials and potential cooperative defaults</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 3.65pt .0001pt 0cm;\"><strong>contractual suppliers, local cooperatives, quality pre-testing, and multiple sourcing options</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>13</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Governance and Capital Risks: Misallocation or weak controls</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>milestone-based <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>disbursement, segregated accounts, IFRS-aligned audits, and investor oversight</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 48.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.31034%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor black black; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"37\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 1.55pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>14</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8161%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt .1pt;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Market Access Risks: Payment delays and counterfeit products</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.8736%; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: currentcolor black black currentcolor; padding: 0.45pt 1.9pt 0cm 4.6pt; height: 48.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"329\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Pre-offtake <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>agreements, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>digital traceability, and diversified distribution channels.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 23:54:08', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(180, 19, 'texte', 'Our Services', NULL, 'Our services', 'Huduma zetu', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AGF delivers a multi-channel platform combining regulated healthcare services, preventive nutrition, digital health access, and community economic empowerment. All clinical activities operate in compliance with applicable national health regulations and aligned with oversight frameworks of the Regulatory Authority.', NULL, 'NUFOTEC offers a multi-channel platform combining regulated health services, preventive nutrition, digital health access, and community economic empowerment. All clinical activities are conducted in accordance with applicable national regulations and aligned with the supervision frameworks of the Regulatory Authority.', 'NUFOTEC inatoa jukwaa la njia nyingi linalochanganya huduma za afya zilizodhibitiwa, lishe ya kuzuia, upatikanaji wa afya dijitali, na uwezeshaji wa kiuchumi wa jamii. Shughuli zote za kliniki zinafanywa kwa kufuata kanuni za kitaifa zinazotumika na kulingana na mifumo ya usimamizi ya Mamlaka ya Udhibiti.', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(181, 19, 'liste', '1) Clinical Consultation Services', NULL, '1) Clinical consultation services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'On-site consultations provided by registered medical practitioners and licensed Nutritionists/Dieticians, offering preventive health assessments, nutritional guidance, and integrative botanical support within regulatory scope via our herbal clinics.', NULL, 'On-site consultations provided by licensed physicians and graduate nutritionists/dietitians, offering preventive health assessments, nutritional advice, and integrative botanical support within the regulatory framework via our herbal medicine clinics.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(182, 19, 'liste', '2) Telehealth & Digital Health Services', NULL, '2) Telehealth and digital health services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Remote consultations via phone and video, structured digital intake systems, and AI-assisted guidance through the \"AGF ONE\" platform to expand access to underserved communities.', NULL, 'Remote consultations by phone and video, structured digital admission systems, and AI-powered assistance through the \"NUFOTEC ONE\" platform to expand access to underserved communities.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(183, 19, 'liste', '3) Preventive Nutrition & Public Health Education', NULL, '3) Preventive nutrition and public health education', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Community-based and digital education programs focused on preventive nutrition, lifestyle improvement, and safe wellness practices delivered via workshops, media broadcasts, and digital platforms.', NULL, 'Community and digital education programs focused on preventive nutrition, lifestyle improvement, and safe wellness practices, delivered through workshops, media broadcasts, and digital platforms.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(184, 19, 'liste', '4) Agricultural & Capacity Development Services', NULL, '4) Agricultural development and capacity building services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Training in organic farming, medicinal plant cultivation, post-harvest handling, and small-scale agro-processing to strengthen rural value chains and supply integrity.', NULL, 'Training in organic farming, medicinal plant cultivation, post-harvest management, and small-scale agro-processing to strengthen rural value chains and supply integrity.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(185, 19, 'liste', '5) Entrepreneurship & Economic Empowerment Services', NULL, '5) Entrepreneurship and economic empowerment services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Community mobilization toward self-employment and income-generating enterprises through structured awareness programs, digital outreach, and value-chain integration.', NULL, 'Community mobilization toward self-employment and income-generating enterprises through structured outreach programs, digital awareness, and value chain integration.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(186, 19, 'liste', '6) Media & Digital Advertising Services', NULL, '6) Media and digital advertising services', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fee-based advertising and promotional services across AGF\'s digital and broadcast platforms to support SMEs while generating sustainable revenue streams.', NULL, 'Paid advertising and promotion services on NUFOTEC\'s digital and broadcast platforms to support SMEs while generating sustainable revenue streams.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(187, 19, 'texte', 'Strategic Impact', NULL, 'Strategic impact', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This integrated service model strengthens healthcare access, promotes preventive wellness, supports SME growth, and enhances ESG-aligned development outcomes—while diversifying AGF\'s revenue base.', NULL, 'This integrated service model strengthens healthcare access, promotes preventive wellness, supports SME growth, and improves development outcomes aligned with ESG criteria, while diversifying NUFOTEC\'s revenue base.', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1),
(188, 2, 'liste', 'Project Fact Sheet', NULL, 'Project fact sheet', NULL, 'Project Title: AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES Integrated Phytopharmaceutical & Nutraceutical Manufacturing facility', NULL, 'Project title: NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES integrated phytopharmaceutical and nutraceutical manufacturing facility', NULL, '<p>Promoter entity: African Green Farmers Ltd (AGF)<br>Location:<br>Registered Address:<br>Mobile:<br>Emails:</p>', NULL, '<p>Promoting entity: African Green Farmers Ltd (NUFOTEC)<br>Location:<br>Registered address:<br>Phone:<br>Emails:</p>', NULL, '/attachments/Sections/2026022713304969a180696a90d.jpg', 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:36', '', NULL, '2026-03-02 14:14:24', '2026-03-02 14:14:24', 1),
(189, 1, 'image_texte', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES – Industrializing Africa’s Medicinal Plant Economy', NULL, 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES – Industrializing Africa\'s medicinal plant economy', NULL, 'INVEST IN US OR BECOME A CONTRACTUAL BROKER WITH US TODAY !?', NULL, 'INVEST IN US OR BECOME OUR CONTRACTUAL BROKER TODAY!?', NULL, '<p><strong>With USD 40+ million as seed capital within the first five years vision (Vision 2026-2031), AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS (AGF) Limited is a vertically integrated agro-industrial Zambian privately-owned agro-industrial biotechnology enterprise steadily engaged in transforming commercial organic farming of target and selective medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits and nutrient-dense agricultural resources into standardized plant-based TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements, clean-label fortified health food products and beverages completely free from added unsafe sugar and chemicals, High-nutrient organic fertilizers as well as scientifically advanced formulation of phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals subjected to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, as well as clean-label fortified health food products and fruit beverages. By integrating climate-smart commercial organic farming, structured out-grower networks, laboratory-driven product profiling, standardization preclinical &amp; clinical trials, and scalable processing infrastructure, AGF shifts agriculture from low-margin primary commodity production to high-value industrial farming and manufacturing. The company is building a growth platform designed to expand cultivated acreage, increase processing capability, strengthen regional export penetration, and generate sustainable employment, especially of youth and women while contributing to Zambia&rsquo;s economic transformation and natural health value chain development.</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are targeting multi-million-dollar annual turnover, sustainable EBITDA performance, and scalable export expansion by 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</p>\r\n<p><strong>In short:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>AGF&rsquo;s facility (AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES) is engaged in manufacturing the following standard and GMP-compliant key products:</strong></p>\r\n<p>A) CAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\r\n<p>B) Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\r\n<p>C) Clean-label Fortified Health Food Products &amp; Beverages for prevention and fight against malnutrition especially among children, pregnant women breast feeding mothers;</p>\r\n<p>D) High-nutrient organic fertilizers for soil regeneration and enrichment;</p>\r\n<p>E) Phytomedicines, targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\r\n<p>F) Phytopharmaceuticals, targeting acute and chronic diseases.</p>\r\n<figure class=\"table\"></figure>', NULL, '<p><strong>With over USD 40 million in seed capital under the five-year vision (Vision 2026-2031), NUFOTEC Limited is a private, vertically integrated agro-industrial biotechnology company based in Burundi, regularly engaged in transforming commercial organic farming of targeted and selected medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits, and nutrient-rich agricultural resources into standardized TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements, clean-label fortified health food and beverage products totally free of added sugars and harmful chemicals, high-nutrition organic fertilizers, as well as scientifically advanced phyto-medicinal and phyto-pharmaceutical formulations submitted to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility. By integrating climate-smart commercial organic farming, structured contract farmer networks, laboratory-driven product profiling, standardization, preclinical and clinical trials, and scalable processing infrastructure, NUFOTEC moves agriculture from low-margin raw material production to industrial agriculture and high-value manufacturing. The company is building a growth platform designed to expand cultivated area, increase processing capacity, strengthen regional export penetration, and generate sustainable employment, particularly for youth and women, while contributing to Burundi\'s economic transformation and the natural health value chain development.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We target multi-million dollar annual revenue, sustainable EBITDA performance, and scalable export expansion by 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</p>\n<p><strong>In brief:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>NUFOTEC facility manufactures the following GMP-compliant standard products:</strong></p>\n<p>A) TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>B) Nutraceuticals/Dietary Supplements targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>C) Clean-label fortified health food and beverage products for the prevention and fight against malnutrition, especially in children, pregnant women, and breastfeeding mothers;</p>\n<p>D) High-nutrition organic fertilizers for soil regeneration and enrichment;</p>\n<p>E) Phytomedicines, targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>\n<p>F) Phytopharmaceuticals, targeting acute and chronic diseases.</p>', NULL, '/attachments/Sections/b2304a36e41cf889f9858d8873b9ac2c.jpg', 1, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-01 15:44:47', 'image_texte', NULL, '2026-03-02 13:24:46', NULL, 1),
(192, 1, 'liste', 'Our Added Value', NULL, 'Our added value', NULL, 'Why choose our teleconsultation platform?', NULL, 'Why choose our teleconsultation platform?', NULL, '<ul>\r\n <li>Fast consultations available 7 days a week</li>\r\n <li>Qualified and certified healthcare professionals</li>\r\n <li>100% secure and confidential platform</li>\r\n  <li>Easy appointment booking in just a few clicks</li>\r\n  <li>Accessible from mobile, tablet, and compute<br />\r\n &nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', NULL, '<ul>\n<li>Fast consultations available 7 days a week</li>\n<li>Qualified and certified healthcare professionals</li>\n<li>100% secure and confidential platform</li>\n<li>Easy appointment booking in a few clicks</li>\n<li>Accessible from mobile, tablet, and computer<br />\n&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'Book an Appointment', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-01 18:42:17', '', NULL, '2026-03-01 18:45:15', NULL, 1),
