(211, 18, 'hero', 'strategic partnerships', 'strategic partnerships', 'Strategic partnerships', 'Ushirikiano wa kimkakati', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners  ', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners  ', 'Financial, technical and scientific partners', 'Washirika wa kifedha, kiufundi na kisayansi', '', '', NULL, NULL, '/attachments/Sections/2026030300030469a60918e5854.jpg', 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '2026-03-03 00:03:04', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 00:03:44', NULL, 1),
(212, 18, 'liste_card', '', '', 'Financial, technical and scientific partners', 'Washirika wa kifedha, kiufundi na kisayansi', '', '', 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory advice and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized and globally credible.', 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES inashirikiana na mtandao uliopangwa kwa uangalifu wa washirika wa ndani, kikanda na kimataifa. Ushirikiano huu unajumuisha utafiti wa kisayansi, uthibitisho wa kimatibabu, utaalamu wa utengenezaji, ushauri wa udhibiti na usaidizi wa kifedha ili kuhakikisha kuwa dawa zote za asili tunazozalisha ni salama, sanifu na zinazoaminika kimataifa.', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm 20.75pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Research &amp; Scientific Validation</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>5.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p>International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Financial &amp; Development Partners</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p>International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGFPHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm 20.75pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Research &amp; Scientific Validation</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>5.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p>International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6.<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Financial &amp; Development Partners</p>\r\n<p>Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p>Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p>Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p>International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGFPHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '2026-03-03 00:09:04', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 00:39:10', '2026-03-03 00:39:10', 1),
(213, 18, 'grille', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', NULL, NULL, 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional, and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory guidance, and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized, and globally credible.', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>1. Research & Scientific Validation</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> University of Zambia – preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town – pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet – mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics – patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional referral hospitals – coordination and management of clinical studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic – oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority – product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities – regional alignment and compliance support.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> World Health Organization – guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local GMP consultants – facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional certification firms – batch standardization and quality assurance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland – GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs – initial toxicity and safety screening.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs – organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec – GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>6. Financial & Development Partners</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs – seed funding and ESG advisory.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank – capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> International Finance Corporation, Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation – impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\"><strong>Conclusion</strong><br>Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGF-PHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</p>', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>1. Research & Scientific Validation</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> University of Zambia – preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town – pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet – mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics – patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional referral hospitals – coordination and management of clinical studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic – oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority – product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities – regional alignment and compliance support.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> World Health Organization – guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local GMP consultants – facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional certification firms – batch standardization and quality assurance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland – GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs – initial toxicity and safety screening.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs – organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec – GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n    <h3>6. Financial & Development Partners</h3>\r\n    <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs – seed funding and ESG advisory.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank – capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>International:</strong> International Finance Corporation, Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation – impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\"><strong>Conclusion</strong><br>Through this integrated network of financial, technical, and scientific partners, AGF-PHYTOMED ensures that every step of its phytopharmaceutical development is scientifically validated, clinically proven, and manufactured to international quality standards. These collaborations allow us to deliver safe, standardized, and globally credible natural medicines that address high-burden chronic diseases while attracting investment, enabling market access, and generating measurable social and health impact.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-03 00:17:14', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h3\"}', '2026-03-03 00:39:01', '2026-03-03 00:39:01', 1),
(214, 18, 'liste', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', NULL, NULL, 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux.', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux.', NULL, NULL, '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>1. Research & Scientific Validation</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Valider les composés végétaux.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Université de Zambie (recherche préclinique).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Université du Cap (études pharmacologiques).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard, Oxford, Karolinska (validation de mécanismes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Mener des études sur l\'homme.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Hôpitaux de Lusaka (recrutement de patients).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Hôpitaux régionaux de référence (coordination).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson, Mayo Clinic (collaboration sur les essais).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Assurer la conformité.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> ZAMRA (enregistrement des produits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Autorités du COMESA (alignement).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Organisation mondiale de la santé (conseils).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Production aux normes BPF.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Consultants locaux en BPF (audits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Sociétés de certification régionales (assurance qualité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland (certification BPF).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Confirmer la sécurité préclinique.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Laboratoires précliniques locaux (criblage de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Laboratoires BPL régionaux (études de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec (études habilitantes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>6. Financial & Development Partners</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Fournir du financement et des conseils ESG.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Banque de Zambie, IFD locales (financement de démarrage).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Banque africaine de développement (mobilisation de capitaux).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> IFC, Fondation Gates (financement à impact).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Grâce à ce réseau intégré, AGF-PHYTOMED s\'assure que le développement de ses produits est scientifiquement validé, cliniquement prouvé et fabriqué selon les normes internationales, nous permettant de fournir des médicaments naturels sûrs et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>1. Research & Scientific Validation</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Valider les composés végétaux.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Université de Zambie (recherche préclinique).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Université du Cap (études pharmacologiques).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Harvard, Oxford, Karolinska (validation de mécanismes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>2. Clinical Trials & Healthcare Networks</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Mener des études sur l\'homme.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Hôpitaux de Lusaka (recrutement de patients).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Hôpitaux régionaux de référence (coordination).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> MD Anderson, Mayo Clinic (collaboration sur les essais).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>3. Regulatory & Market Authorization</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Assurer la conformité.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> ZAMRA (enregistrement des produits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Autorités du COMESA (alignement).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Organisation mondiale de la santé (conseils).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>4. Manufacturing & Quality Assurance</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Production aux normes BPF.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Consultants locaux en BPF (audits).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Sociétés de certification régionales (assurance qualité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> SGS, Bureau Veritas, TÜV Rheinland (certification BPF).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>5. Safety & Preclinical Testing</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Confirmer la sécurité préclinique.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Laboratoires précliniques locaux (criblage de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Laboratoires BPL régionaux (études de toxicité).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> Charles River Laboratories, Evotec (études habilitantes).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n    <li><strong>6. Financial & Development Partners</strong>\r\n        <ul>\r\n            <li><em>Objectif:</em> Fournir du financement et des conseils ESG.</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Domestique:</strong> Banque de Zambie, IFD locales (financement de démarrage).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>Régional:</strong> Banque africaine de développement (mobilisation de capitaux).</li>\r\n            <li><strong>International:</strong> IFC, Fondation Gates (financement à impact).</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> Grâce à ce réseau intégré, AGF-PHYTOMED s\'assure que le développement de ses produits est scientifiquement validé, cliniquement prouvé et fabriqué selon les normes internationales, nous permettant de fournir des médicaments naturels sûrs et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:09', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 00:38:50', '2026-03-03 00:38:49', 1),
(215, 18, 'liste_card', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', NULL, NULL, 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', NULL, NULL, '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Domestic: Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:41', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h4\"}', '2026-03-03 00:49:58', '2026-03-03 00:49:57', 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(216, 18, 'texte', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'Financial, Technical and Scientific Partners', 'Financial, technical and scientific partners', 'Washirika wa kifedha, kiufundi na kisayansi', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', 'AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY collabore avec un réseau soigneusement structuré de partenaires domestiques, régionaux et internationaux. Ces partenariats intègrent la recherche scientifique, la validation clinique, l\'expertise en fabrication, les conseils réglementaires et le soutien financier afin de garantir que tous les médicaments naturels que nous produisons sont sûrs, standardisés et crédibles à l\'échelle mondiale.', 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES collaborates with a carefully structured network of domestic, regional and international partners. These partnerships integrate scientific research, clinical validation, manufacturing expertise, regulatory advice and financial support to ensure that all natural medicines we produce are safe, standardized and globally credible.', 'NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES inashirikiana na mtandao uliopangwa kwa uangalifu wa washirika wa ndani, kikanda na kimataifa. Ushirikiano huu unajumuisha utafiti wa kisayansi, uthibitisho wa kimatibabu, utaalamu wa utengenezaji, ushauri wa udhibiti na usaidizi wa kifedha ili kuhakikisha kuwa dawa zote za asili tunazozalisha ni salama, sanifu na zinazoaminika kimataifa.', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose: </strong>Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', '<div class=\"partner-category\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Research &amp; Scientific Validation:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose: </strong>Validate plant-based compounds for chronic diseases including cancer, diabetes, and cardiovascular conditions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>University of Zambia &ndash; preclinical research, biomarker identification, and translational studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> University of Cape Town &ndash; pharmacology studies and chronic disease modeling. International: Harvard Medical School, University of Oxford, Karolinska Institutet &ndash; mechanism validation, translational research, and joint intellectual property development.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic: </strong>Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\">Conclusion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"conclusion\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-03 00:20:41', 'partners-grid', '{\"layout\": \"grid\", \"columns\": 2, \"card_style\": \"bordered\", \"gap\": \"lg\", \"padding\": \"md\", \"bg_color\": \"#f8f9fa\", \"title_size\": \"h4\"}', '2026-03-03 01:22:33', NULL, 1),
