 donors can trust that funds are managed efficiently, ethically, and in full compliance.</strong></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:46:40', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:24:36', '2026-03-03 02:24:34', 1),
(223, 15, 'grille', 'Investment Opportunities', 'Investment Opportunities', 'Investment opportunities', 'Fursa za uwekezaji', '   AGF offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:', '   AGF offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:', 'NUFOTEC offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:', 'NUFOTEC inatoa fursa za uwekezaji zilizoundwa kimkakati ili kuzalisha mapato yanayoweza kupimika huku ikisaidia afya, lishe, maendeleo ya kiuchumi endelevu na mipango ya kilimo endelevu:', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Seed and growth-stage funding for AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES and digital platforms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Co-investment opportunities with regional and international partners</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>ESG-aligned projects focusing on preventive nutrition, functional foods, and organic farming of target medicinal plants, functional nutrient-dense crops, fruits and vegetables serving as raw materials for our manufacturing facility</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Investments are linked to clear KPIs and market expansion metrics, ensuring measurable impact and visibility.</strong></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Seed and growth-stage funding for AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES and digital platforms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Co-investment opportunities with regional and international partners</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>ESG-aligned projects focusing on preventive nutrition, functional foods, and organic farming of target medicinal plants, functional nutrient-dense crops, fruits and vegetables serving as raw materials for our manufacturing facility</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Investments are linked to clear KPIs and market expansion metrics, ensuring measurable impact and visibility.</strong></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 3, '2026-03-03 01:49:47', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:23:43', '2026-03-03 02:23:43', 1),
(224, 15, 'liste', 'Donor Engagement and Impact', 'Donor Engagement and Impact', 'Donor engagement and impact', 'Ushirikiano wa wafadhili na athari', 'Donors are a critical part of AGF’s mission. We provide:', 'Donors are a critical part of AGF’s mission. We provide:', 'Donors are an essential part of NUFOTEC\'s mission. We provide:', 'Wafadhili ni sehemu muhimu ya dhamira ya NUFOTEC. Tunatoa:', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Regular impact reports highlighting social, environmental, and health outcomes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Transparent tracking of funds toward community programs, research, and digital outreach</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Recognition of donors in line with preferences and contribution scale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Donors can see how every contribution translates into real-world health, economic, gendersensitive job creation and social impact.</strong></span></p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Regular impact reports highlighting social, environmental, and health outcomes</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Transparent tracking of funds toward community programs, research, and digital outreach</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Recognition of donors in line with preferences and contribution scale</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;\"> </span></span></span>Donors can see how every contribution translates into real-world health, economic, gendersensitive job creation and social impact.</strong></span></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '2026-03-03 01:53:29', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:24:23', '2026-03-03 02:24:23', 1),
(225, 14, 'hero', 'Phased Investment Projection ', 'Phased Investment Projection ', 'Investment projection by phase', 'Makadirio ya uwekezaji kwa awamu', 'Phased Investment Projection ', 'Phased Investment Projection ', 'Investment projection by phase', 'Makadirio ya uwekezaji kwa awamu', '', '', NULL, NULL, '/attachments/Sections/2026030302450869a62f149a178.jpg', 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 0, '2026-03-03 02:45:08', '', NULL, '2026-03-03 02:57:39', '2026-03-03 02:57:39', 1),
(226, 14, 'hero', 'Phased Investment Projection', 'Phased Investment Projection', 'Investment projection by phase', 'Makadirio ya uwekezaji kwa awamu', 'USD 40+ Million Seed Capital (2026–2029)', 'USD 40+ Million Seed Capital (2026–2029)', 'Over USD 40 million seed capital (2026–2029)', 'Zaidi ya dola za Marekani milioni 40 za mtaji wa awali (2026–2029)', '<p class=\"lead\">African Green Farmers Limited (AGF) &ndash; AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY &ndash; seeks to mobilize USD 40+ million in phased seed capital dedicated to construction, commissioning, and operationalization of a GMP-compliant phytomedicine and nutraceutical processing facility.</p>', '<p class=\"lead\">African Green Farmers Limited (AGF) &ndash; AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES FACILITY &ndash; seeks to mobilize USD 40+ million in phased seed capital dedicated to construction, commissioning, and operationalization of a GMP-compliant phytomedicine and nutraceutical processing facility.</p>', '<p class=\"lead\">African Green Farmers Limited (NUFOTEC) &ndash; NUFOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES &ndash; seeks to mobilize over USD 40 million in phased seed capital dedicated to the construction, commissioning and operationalization of a GMP-compliant phytomedicine and nutraceutical processing facility.</p>', '<p class=\"lead\">African Green Farmers Limited (NUFOTEC) &ndash; NUOTEC-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES &ndash; inatafuta kuongeza zaidi ya dola za Marekani milioni 40 za mtaji wa awali kwa awamu uliowekwa kwa ajili ya ujenzi, kuwezesha na kuwezesha kituo cha usindikaji wa dawa za mimea na lishe kinachozingatia GMP.</p>', '/attachments/Sections/2026030302571969a631efd9092.jpg', 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, '2026-03-03 02:54:12', 'investment-hero', '{\"overlay_opacity\": 0.7, \"height\": \"70vh\"}', '2026-03-03 02:57:19', NULL, 1),
(227, 14, 'texte', 'Strategic Investment Approach', 'Strategic Investment Approach', 'Strategic investment approach', 'Mbinu ya kimkakati ya uwekezaji', 'Years 1-5: No Seed Capital to Farming', 'Years 1-5: No Seed Capital to Farming', 'Years 1 to 5: No seed capital for agriculture', 'Miaka 1 hadi 5: Hakuna mtaji wa awali kwa kilimo', '<div class=\"investment-highlight\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 2px solid var(--accent);\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px;\">$40+ Million <span style=\"color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; display: block;\">Seed Capital</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">During the first 5 years of operation, AGF will not allocate seed capital to commercial farming activities. All raw botanical, Spirulina and organic fertilizer inputs will be secured through structured external contractual supply agreements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 20px;\">This model significantly reduces early-stage agricultural risk and accelerates industrial revenue generation.</p>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"investment-highlight\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 2px solid var(--accent);\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px;\">$40+ Million <span style=\"color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; display: block;\">Seed Capital</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">During the first 5 years of operation, AGF will not allocate seed capital to commercial farming activities. All raw botanical, Spirulina and organic fertilizer inputs will be secured through structured external contractual supply agreements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 20px;\">This model significantly reduces early-stage agricultural risk and accelerates industrial revenue generation.</p>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"investment-highlight\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 2px solid var(--accent);\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Over USD 40 million <span style=\"color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; display: block;\">Seed capital</span></div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">During the first 5 years of operation, NUFOTEC will not allocate seed capital to commercial farming activities. All crude botanical, spirulina and organic fertilizer inputs will be obtained through structured external contract supply agreements.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 20px;\">This model significantly reduces agricultural startup risks and accelerates industrial revenue generation.</p>\n</div>', '<div class=\"investment-highlight\" style=\"background: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 2px solid var(--accent);\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Zaidi ya dola za Marekani milioni 40 <span style=\"color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; display: block;\">Mtaji wa awali</span></div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">Katika miaka 5 ya kwanza ya operesheni, NUFOTEC haitatenga mtaji wa awali kwa shughuli za kilimo cha kibiashara. Malighafi yote ya mimea, spirulina na mbolea za kikaboni yatapatikana kupitia mikataba ya ugavi wa nje iliyopangwa kimuundo.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 20px;\">Mfano huu unapunguza kwa kiasi kikubwa hatari za kuanza kwa kilimo na kuharakisha uzalishaji wa mapato ya kiviwanda.</p>\n</div>', NULL, 0, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'investment-overview', '{\"text_align\": \"center\"}', '2026-03-03 03:12:43', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO `sections_contenu` (`id_section`, `id_page`, `type_section`, `titre_section`, `titre_section_fr`, `titre_section_en`, `titre_section_sw`, `sous_titre`, `sous_titre_fr`, `sous_titre_en`, `sous_titre_sw`, `contenu_texte`, `contenu_texte_fr`, `contenu_texte_en`, `contenu_texte_sw`, `image_url`, `image_droite`, `bouton_texte`, `bouton_texte_fr`, `bouton_texte_en`, `bouton_texte_sw`, `bouton_lien`, `ordre`, `created_at`, `custom_class`, `options_json`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `est_active`) VALUES
(228, 14, 'grille_card', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy', 'Seed capital allocation strategy', 'Mkakati wa ugawaji wa mtaji wa awali', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy (Years 1–5) ', 'Seed Capital Allocation Strategy (Years 1–5) ', 'Seed capital allocation strategy (Years 1 to 5)', 'Mkakati wa ugawaji wa mtaji wa awali (Miaka 1 hadi 5)', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">A.<span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Facility Construction &amp; Industrial Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction of the AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES processing facility</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pre-built GMP cleanrooms for critical processing zones</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->HVAC systems with controlled pressure gradients</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clean steam and purified water systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste management and solvent recovery systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Hybrid power systems (solar + backup generation)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fire suppression and safety compliance systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stuff Residential Units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">B. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Processing &amp; Production Equipment </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">A fully automated and integrated high-throughput<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"> </em>Turnkey <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Ultrasound-Assisted Extraction (UAE) Line System</em> integrating (In a single line system) essentially post-harvest processing of plant raw materials, validated solvent-based extraction, concentration, chromatographic purification, vacuum drying, micronization and ultrasonic vibratory sieving, anti-cracking agent aseptic incorporation, capsule and tablet production, bottle filling, capping and sealing, cartooning, instructional labeling and leaflet inserting, post-packaging High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization (Non-thermal sterilization) and case packaging.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This is a GMP-Compliant manufacturing efficiency within a single continuous end-to-end line system, approximately 60m x 5m in size. The line system manufactures any target extracts from any medicinal plants based on our need. This is the only processing line system to be secured using the seed capital.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">The rest of manufacturing line systems such as the Soybean Product (Fortified Liquid Soymilk, Soymilk Powder and Vacuum-dried Tofu) Integrated Manufacturing Line System, Spirulina Algae Supplement Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, Fruit Juice Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, and Organic Fertilizer Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System will be secured and utilized using the facility&rsquo;s income-generating activities, mainly sales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">C. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Laboratory &amp; Quality Control Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 12.8pt;\">Analytical laboratory and scientific research laboratory equipment, including UHPLCMS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000,<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></strong>HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer for:<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Microbiology laboratory </strong>for testing microorganisms and biological contamination of raw materials and finished products</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Analytical laboratory (QC Lab)</strong> that performs testing for product profiling and standardization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Preclinical <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>laboratory</strong> <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>performing <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>product <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>toxicology, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>safety, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and pharmacokinetics</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">GLP </strong>(Good Laboratory Practice) <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">laboratory </strong>that generates non-clinical data before human trials</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Clinical research laboratory</strong> that analyses clinical study samples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">D. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Regulatory, Licensing &amp; Certification </span></h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Regulatory and licensing in which the seed capital will be utilized include the following:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) Certificate- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Screening EPB Report Certificate- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste Management Licence- ZEMA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Site Approval Certificate- ZMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Product Registration- ZMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->GMP Inspection- ZAMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Manufacturing Licence- ZAMRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Investor Permit- IMMIGRATION</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Product Testing &amp; Application- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 14.05pt;\">Factory Inspection- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Certification Mark- ZABS</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Premises Hygiene Clearance Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal/District Health Office)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Food Safety Inspection/Compliance Certificate-<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Food Handling/Safety Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Occupational Health Risk Assessment Certificate- Local Health Department (Munispal/ District<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Local Health Department (Munispal /District Health Office)- Annual Health Compliance Verification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Land Title Deeds- Headmen, Chief, Chiebombo District, Province &amp;Ministry of Land</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001-Quality Management System- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 9001-Quality Management System- Annual Surveillance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 22000-Food Safety</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001- Environmental Gouvernance and Sustainability- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14001- Environmental Gouvernance and Sustainability- Annual Surveillance</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001- Occupational Health &amp; Safety- Initial Certification</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 45001- Occupational Health &amp; Safety- Annual Surveillance Audits</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644- Cleanroom Qualification ISO 5/Room x 10</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO 14644- Cleanroom Annual Re-certification Audits ISO 5/Room x 10</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">E. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Operationalization &amp; Market Deployment </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Salaries for skilled staff recruitment and training</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Salaries for executive management<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Rent of headquarters, domestic health shops<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>and regional distribution outlets</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Distribution fleet acquisition</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Executive coordination vehicle</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ERP and digital traceability systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Branding, packaging design, and market launch</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Insurance (facility, liability, professional indemnity)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Security systems and facility access control</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">A.<span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Facility Construction &amp; Industrial Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction of the AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES processing facility</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pre-built GMP cleanrooms for critical processing zones</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->HVAC systems with controlled pressure gradients</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clean steam and purified water systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste management and solvent recovery systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Hybrid power systems (solar + backup generation)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fire suppression and safety compliance systems</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&Oslash;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stuff Residential Units</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">B. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Processing &amp; Production Equipment </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">A fully automated and integrated high-throughput<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"> </em>Turnkey <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Ultrasound-Assisted Extraction (UAE) Line System</em> integrating (In a single line system) essentially post-harvest processing of plant raw materials, validated solvent-based extraction, concentration, chromatographic purification, vacuum drying, micronization and ultrasonic vibratory sieving, anti-cracking agent aseptic incorporation, capsule and tablet production, bottle filling, capping and sealing, cartooning, instructional labeling and leaflet inserting, post-packaging High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization (Non-thermal sterilization) and case packaging.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This is a GMP-Compliant manufacturing efficiency within a single continuous end-to-end line system, approximately 60m x 5m in size. The line system manufactures any target extracts from any medicinal plants based on our need. This is the only processing line system to be secured using the seed capital.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">The rest of manufacturing line systems such as the Soybean Product (Fortified Liquid Soymilk, Soymilk Powder and Vacuum-dried Tofu) Integrated Manufacturing Line System, Spirulina Algae Supplement Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, Fruit Juice Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, and Organic Fertilizer Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System will be secured and utilized using the facility&rsquo;s income-generating activities, mainly sales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">C. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Laboratory &amp; Quality Control Infrastructure </span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 12.8pt;\">Analytical laboratory and scientific research laboratory equipment, including UHPLCMS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000,<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;\"> </span></strong>HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer for:<span style=\"color: red;\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Microbiology laboratory </strong>for testing microorganisms and biological contamination of raw materials and finished products</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Analytical laboratory (QC Lab)</strong> that performs testing for product profiling and standardization</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Preclinical <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>laboratory</strong> <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>performing <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>product <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>toxicology, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> </span>safety, <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and pharmacokinetics</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">GLP </strong>(Good Laboratory Practice) <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">laboratory </strong>that generates non-clinical data before human trials</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Clinical research laboratory</strong> that analyses clinical study samples</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h4 class=\"card-title\">D. <span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Investing in Regulatory, Licensing &amp; Certification </span></h4>\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Regulatory and licensing in which the seed capital will be utilized include the following:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]