of Land</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 9001 Quality Management</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 22000 Food Safety</td><td>Certification</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 14001 Environmental</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 45001 Health & Safety</td><td>Initial + Annual</td></tr>\r\n            <tr><td>ISO 14644 Cleanroom</td><td>ISO 5 (10 rooms)</td></tr>\r\n        </tbody>\r\n    </table>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, '2026-03-03 02:54:13', 'regulatory-table', '{\"striped\": true, \"bordered\": true}', NULL, NULL, 1),
(230, 14, 'liste_card', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', 'Raw materials (Years 1 to 5)', 'Malighafi (Miaka 1 hadi 5)', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', 'Raw Material (Years 1–5) ', 'Raw materials (Years 1 to 5)', 'Malighafi (Miaka 1 hadi 5)', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">During the first operational phase:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Raw medicinal plant materials sourced through contractual supplier agreements</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Spirulina biomass procured through structured external production partnerships</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Multi-supplier diversification to reduce dependency risk</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportList