 Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Multi-supplier diversification to reduce dependency risk</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quality specifications enforced through pre-supply laboratory validation</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This strategy ensures:</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Lower early-stage capital exposure</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced climate and agricultural production risk</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster time-to-market</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Immediate focus on value-added processing</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">During the first phase of operation:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Medicinal plant raw materials supplied through contractual supplier agreements</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Spirulina biomass supplied through structured external production partnerships</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Multi-supplier diversification to reduce dependency risk</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quality specifications enforced by laboratory validation before supply</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">This strategy ensures:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Lower capital exposure in startup phase</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Reduced climate and agricultural production risk</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Faster time-to-market</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Immediate focus on value-added processing</p>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Wakati wa awamu ya kwanza ya uendeshaji:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Malighafi ya mimea ya dawa hutolewa kupitia makubaliano ya ugavi wa mkandarasi</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Biomasa ya spirulina hutolewa kupitia ubia wa uzalishaji wa nje uliopangwa</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Utofautishaji wa wauzaji wengi ili kupunguza hatari ya utegemezi</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Vipimo vya ubora vinavyotekelezwa na uthibitisho wa maabara kabla ya ugavi</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;\">Mkakati huu unahakikisha:</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&sect;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mfiduo mdogo wa mtaji katika awamu ya kuanza</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=