(8, 3, 2, 'INSTANT FORTIFIED SOYMILK POWDER PROCESSING WORKFLOW: ', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">With our customized, fully integrated and automated Turnkey Line System designed specifically for Fortified Liquid Soybean Milk, Soymilk Powder and Fortified Tofu: </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 1: Raw materials (Dry soybeans) reception and inspection </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 2: Cleaning, grading and sorting </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 3: Dehulling and soaking </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 4: Wet grinding<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 5: Slurry heating </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 6: Filtration (Okra separation) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 7: Enzymatic deactivation </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 8: Homogenization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 9: Initial profiling and standardization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: -36.0pt; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt 35.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 10: Ultra-High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization (Post-harvest) at 40&deg;C (Temperature) and 400600 MPa (Pressure). for microbial control before the processing takes place </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt 0cm;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 11: Initial profiling and Initial standardization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 12: Vacuum drying into fine powder </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 31.65pt .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 13: Jet milling (Micronizer) for micronization into ultrafine powder (1-10 micrometers (Increased<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>surface area, better homogeneity, improved stability, enhanced absorption) Step 14: Ultrasonic vibratory sieving (Vibrating Screen Classifer) and cooling </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 15: Anti-caking agent incorporation (e. g. silicon dioxide) with High-Snear mixer </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 99%; margin: 0cm .6pt .15pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 99%;\">Step16: Aseptic micronutrient fortification (<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Vitamins A, B-complex, C, D and E, Omega-3, zinc,<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>selenium, magnesium, cysteine</em>,, etc., natural flavoring agents)<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"> </em></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 17: Final product profiling and micronutrient standardization </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 18: Aseptic filling<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"> </strong>into 250g, 500g and 1kg tinplate milk cans with EOE &amp; plastic overcap </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 19: Nitrogen flashing and can sealing </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 20: Instructional labeling &amp; batch coding </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 26.05pt .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 11: Post-packaging sterilization with Ultra-High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization for high-<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>risk products, to maximize safety with regard to pathogen content of the finished products Step 22: Case packaging (6 cans/box) </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 103%; margin: 0cm 0cm .7pt -.25pt;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%;\">Step 23: Plastic crate packaging </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-lan